  "methodology": "Real host logs, owned TCP listeners, DWP handshake, PDB sequence points and accepted source breakpoints. Runtime/server opt-in also requires a matching breakpoint event. Editor reload, Play/Stop and error buffer are queried through its private MCP session. Concurrent ordinary Release runtimes load a production Build Game pack while the verifier binds 2550. OLO_WITH_CSHARP=OFF controls assembly targets on Windows; missing-assembly checks temporarily remove only the probe cwd assemblies and restore them. Linux Mono-free host startup is covered separately by PR CI.",
